<title>UK: WestHyp sets 100 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp sets 100 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    13.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEAR ONE THEN IF NOT CALLED STEPS-UP YEARLY TO</p>
<p>		4.25 PCT, 5.0 PCT, 5.25 PCT AND 6.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
